### Stores, roles, invitations, audit log (run http/auth.http first to get an access token)

@base = http://localhost:8080

### Create a store (caller becomes Owner)
POST {{base}}/admin/v1/stores
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"handle": "acme", "name": "Acme Outfitters", "currency": "USD"}

> {% client.global.set("storeId", response.body.id); %}

### My stores
GET {{base}}/admin/v1/stores
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Roles (Owner + Staff are created with the store)
GET {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create a custom role
POST {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Support", "permissions": ["orders:read", "customers:read"]}

> {% client.global.set("roleId", response.body.id); %}

### Invite someone (email appears in Mailpit: http://localhost:8025)
POST {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "support@example.test", "roleId": "{{roleId}}"}

### Accept (as the INVITED user: log in as them first; token from the link after "&token=")
POST {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/invitations/acceptance
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"token": "PASTE_TOKEN"}

### Members
GET {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Audit log (newest first, cursor-paginated)
GET {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/audit-log?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
